build.notes:
Skeleton (b6deebf) files untouched: git diff b6deebf..HEAD shows only the 8 new files listed. em_search.{hpp,cpp} not touched. Commits: a27a175 (core + binding WIP), 3f1778c (rows, parity file, ctest pins WIP), ee0d814 (final: measured blocking figures in em_refine.hpp, threads test, fast tier trimmed). Nothing pushed.

Spy handling (report as asked): em.rereceive is not the native row in two places, test_qrss_em.py::test_p4_em_smoke_tiny (monkeypatched spy) and test_qrss_native_store.py's EM run. em_refine's row then passes `_seams={"rereceive": rr}`, where rr calls the current em.rereceive with the reference's objects (`_rx.to_ref`) as `rereceive(p, prior, hdr, cw_known, estimator, r, path=..., return_path=True)`. The C++ calls it with the GIL held. Both tests pass under --native-qrss=rx. rereceive's own internals cannot be seamed.

Fast tier of the parity file: 33 tests in 42.5 s on the shared 4 CPUs at load ~1.4, slightly over the ~40 s target. To trim it I moved test_pass_path[short-6] and test_rereceive[short-6-hdr-noprior-cw] to slow. The rest of the time is mostly the first SHORT pass's simulation plus the reference's own rereceive. Slow tier: 25 tests in four commands of 14, 67, 27 and 57 s.

ctest qrss_core_em_refine runs in 4.5 s. It covers:
- pins: the capture digests, pass_path (both Z_ref and the branch), rereceive plain/prior/SHORT split/no-split/no-prior, em_refine with rounds 3 and 0 (history, log, member em_round and mean W);
- progress semantics, including the 'converged after round 2' call;
- cancel set before the call, cancel inside rereceive, and cancel set from the progress hook. That last case throws Cancelled after one pass is stored, and a fresh Store then loads every pass file and the accumulator with no .tmp files left;
- the EmSeams stub: member order, the path handed back the next round, a nullopt pass not stored, a no-capture member skipped;
- refusals.

The generator takes ~22 s of Python: `PYTHONPATH=. python native/tests/qrss/gen_em_refine_pins.py`.

Not run: the slow P4/P5 EM tests in test_qrss_em.py (8 MEDIUM passes acquired blind, each well beyond the 3-minute command limit). All basetemp directories were deleted. Scratch timing scripts are in the scratchpad's emr/ directory.

